      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Looked this up and 3dx says it's a unity bug and Unity says its a 3dx bug.\n\nHighly infuriating.\n\nIn the old versions you could avoid the situation by disabling the controller emulator part and do a Windows repair.\n\nBut all versions released in 2022 don't allow the emulator to be disabled in the device manager.\n\nI'll do some more testing this weekend.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
