      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{612471ae48508846bc0c2d0e|full_name}: I think this PowerShell worked for me last time. I didn't need to repair Windows. `Get-PnpDevice -InstanceId 'HID\\3DXKMJ_*' -Class HIDClass | Disable-PnpDevice`",
